  Slug: impossible-alloy
  DisplayName: Impossible Alloy
  IconPath: icons/commodities/metal/ingot-rough-steel.webp
  Description: Other inventors claim it's not even technically possible, but you've
    managed to create several metal alloys that seem to work for only you. These
    alloys can damage opponents vulnerable to any one of the seven skymetals. Your
    innovation is treated as all seven skymetals (abysium, adamantine, djezet, inubrix,
    noqual, orichalcum, and siccatite). This means you deal more damage to a variety
    of creatures, though you don't apply any of the other special effects for weapons
    made of those skymetals.
